1 0 0 1 60 742 Tm
/F1 13 Tf
(3. What the Lamp Recorded) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(The lens was a machine of brass and glass that turned on a clockwork drum. Maren cleaned it) Tj
T*
(the way she imagined her grandmother had, with a soft cloth and a great deal of patience.) Tj
T*
T*
(Behind the glass the flame flattened and widened. She wrote down the time, the weather, the) Tj
T*
(number of ships that answered. The numbers mattered. Somebody, somewhere, was reading them.) Tj
T*
T*
(That night a ship answered. Three short flashes, meaning all well. Maren wrote it down, and) Tj
T*
(then sat for a while in the dark, letting the beam go over her face again and again.) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(4. The Long Dark Interval) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(The dark interval began on a Thursday and lasted four days. The generator failed, the spare) Tj
T*
(coil was corroded, and the road was under water.) Tj
T*
T*
(She trimmed wick by hand every four hours through the long nights, moving the lamp with a) Tj
T*
(rope and a shoulder, holding the light on the channel the way she had been taught - a foot) Tj
T*
(left of the marker, no more, no less.) Tj
T*
T*
(The ships kept coming in. She counted nine of them, and she never once wrote the word) Tj
T*
(failure in the ledger, because it had not happened. The light was still there. That was the) Tj
T*
(whole of the job.) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(5. A Light Kept Anyway) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(The relief boat came in spring. Maren handed over the key, the tin, and the book with the) Tj
T*
(leather spine, and said nothing about the eleven days of wind or the ship that answered.) Tj
T*
T*
(The new keeper read the ledger for a long time. At the entry for the thirty- first night he) Tj
T*
(stopped and looked up, and Maren told him what she had done with the rope, and the foot left) Tj
T*
(of the marker.) Tj
T*
T*
(Then she walked up the path to the bus, carrying nothing much, in a coat that smelled of oil) Tj
T*
(and salt. Behind her the lamp turned, and kept turning, and the light did not go out.) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(End of document. Synthetic content for Lirune Reader QA only.) Tj
T*
